Package: PeakAnnoAgent
Title: R Interface to the PeakAnnoAgent Peak Annotation Program
Version: 1.1.0
Authors@R: person("Hua", "Huang", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "helenhuang.math@gmail.com")
Description: A thin R interface to the 'peakannoagent' Python program, which
    annotates genomic peaks (ChIP-seq, ATAC-seq, CUT&Tag) against a choice of
    gene models and runs pathway and motif enrichment. The functions call the
    'peakanno-agent' command and return its tables as data frames. The Python
    program must be installed separately ('pip install peakannoagent').
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1)
Imports:
    jsonlite,
    utils
SystemRequirements: Python (>= 3.10) with the 'peakannoagent' package
URL: https://github.com/helenhuangmath/PeakAnnoAgent
BugReports: https://github.com/helenhuangmath/PeakAnnoAgent/issues
